−40Ce⁵ˣ = 21e⁵ˣ
C = −21/40
**For −0.3x + 27x²**: Try yₚ₂ = ax² + bx + c
y' = 2ax + b, y'' = 2a
2a − 4(2ax + b) − 45(ax² + bx + c) = 27x² − 0.3x
−45ax² + (−8a − 45b)x + (2a − 4b − 45c) = 27x² − 0.3x + 0
